a3baac2b772a2da685a0771edb54bb863d266c93185d5ebe8f1\"\n+      }\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"pending\": [\n+    \"fresh scoped Companion Gate\",\n+    \"final PR HEAD CI/security\",\n+    \"merge SHA main CI/security\",\n+    \"Issue completion\"\n+  ]\n+}"},{"sha":"9327ffc27810b401f220aaaee01d704d5236ed2d","filename":"docs/benchmarks/raw/2026-10-index-build-budget/delivery-fix-companion-gate.json","status":"added","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changes":7,"blob_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/blob/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-companion-gate.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/raw/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-companion-gate.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albert-einshutoin/qzt/contents/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-companion-gate.json?ref=3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+{\n+  \"status\": 0,\n+  \"threadId\": \"01a12694-2ae1-7e13-8da3-3a522c8616f6\",\n+  \"rawOutput\": \"ALLOW: 指定範囲のPR345修正に、直接の受入・回帰・security・provenance上のBLOCKはありません。\\n\\n- adapterはstdin 4096 bytes/4行、生成上限100MiB、`create_new`を維持。[index-build-budget-corpus.rs:13](/Volumes/Satechi/Developer/qzt-index-budget-delivery-20261011/scripts/index-build-budget-corpus.rs:13)\\n- 5項目の明示予算を既存matrixへ伝播し、`ResourceLimitExceeded`のみ記録して継続、他エラーはpanic。[release_hardening.rs:110](/Volumes/Satechi/Developer/qzt-index-budget-delivery-20261011/tests/release_hardening.rs:110)\\n- 空stdout期待値のClippy修正を確認。\\n- 原本/派生digest、43原本・244 streams・96 local-onlyの境界を明示。[delivery-evidence.json:888](/Volumes/Satechi/Developer/qzt-index-budget-delivery-20261011/docs/benchmarks/2026-10-index-build-budget-delivery-evidence.json:888)\\n- checkpoint記載の対象ファイルSHA256は現物と一致。製品5 sourceもcompletion receiptと一致。\\n- `git diff --check`問題なし。コード実行・test・import・networkは未実施。\\n\\n制約として、最終HEAD CI/security、merge SHAのmain検証、Issue完了は未達のままです。100MiB完走、strict RSS/OOM防止、G3全体、第三者検証、production-ready、公開releaseも未達保持です。\\n\\n指定外の未追跡補助ファイルは内容判定対象外のため、commit時のstage対象を明示選別してください。\",\n+  \"touchedFiles\": [],\n+  \"reasoningSummary\": []\n+}"},{"sha":"ea3aa762978eab8ba1578a731e59ba191f05a2b5","filename":"docs/benchmarks/raw/2026-10-index-build-budget/delivery-fix-companion-prompt.txt","status":"added","additions":43,"deletions":0,"changes":43,"blob_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/blob/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-companion-prompt.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/raw/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-companion-prompt.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albert-einshutoin/qzt/contents/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-companion-prompt.txt?ref=3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@\n+Run a stop-gate review of the previous Claude turn.\n+日本語、先頭ALLOW:またはBLOCK:。今回のPR345のCI/review修正だけをREAD_ONLY/STATIC_ONLYで確認。\n+worktree=/Volumes/Satechi/Developer/qzt-index-budget-delivery-20261011\n+base9cf2c7c66a88c9f37a67567e5fa2247941b93dea、current HEAD31457cb94b3a234970d7c5d0b596b6e2b33967e7、これから同じPRをamend更新する未commit差分。\n+ユーザーはこの1 Issue344/PR345に限りcommit/push/normal hosted CI/review対応/merge/Issue完了を許可した。\n+tag/release/crates.io/公開pre6asset変更、CI基盤変更、他Issueへ継続はしない。\n+編集、コード実行/import/test、network、DB/env/secrets、subagentは禁止。指定fileのread/hashとdiff確認のみ。\n+\n+指定file:\n+scripts/index-build-budget-corpus.rs\n+tests/phase49_index_build_budgets.rs\n+tests/release_hardening.rs\n+docs/benchmarks/2026-10-index-build-budget-reproduce.md\n+docs/benchmarks/2026-10-index-build-budget-delivery.md\n+docs/benchmarks/2026-10-index-build-budget-delivery-evidence.json\n+raw=docs/benchmarks/raw/2026-10-index-build-budget/\n+raw/golden-provenance.json\n+raw/delivery-fix-checkpoint.json\n+raw/delivery-fix-specialist-review.md\n+raw/delivery-fix-consumer-clippy-fixed.log\n+raw/delivery-fix-consumer-targeted-fixed.log\n+raw/delivery-fix-portable-fixed.log\n+raw/delivery-fix-corpus-input-checks.json\n+raw/delivery-fix-gitleaks-final-packaging.log\n+source5filesは必要ならcompletion-receipt.jsonへhash照合のみ。全repo探索/製品の再設計レビューはしない。\n+\n+修正: Rust1.99追加Clippy lintに空stdout期待値assert_eqへ。adapterはargvを全廃、stdin4096byte/4行、生成<=100MiB、create_newを維持。\n+PR P2コメントに対しprofile matrixの5明示env予算を既存benchmark optionsへ伝播し、既定値は製品defaultのまま。\n+ResourceLimitExceededのみ非成功と記録して後続caseへ、その他のerrorはpanic。自動増額・fallbackはなし。\n+旧golden JSONのSHA256値をgitleaks/GitGuardianがgeneric secret誤検出したが、小hex bytes照合済みdigestでありsecretではない。\n+原JSONは旧worktreeでそのまま保持、Gitへはtyped digest inventoryを派生し元の所在/hashをexcluded local-onlyへ記録した。\n+検出除外設定/check無効化はしない。初回HEAD/CI失敗ログは保存し、自己branchの単一commitだけamend、remote31457照合付きforce-with-lease予定。\n+元主checkout/.devloopと既存証拠worktreeを保護する。\n+\n+検証: phase49 10PASS、release_hardening4PASS/2ignored、Clippy成功、C2/C4 1MiBportable成功、adapter不正/既存output拒否5件成功、compact evidence gitleaks findings0。\n+Sol medium専門reviewはこの修正範囲Approve。製品5sourceは旧receiptとhash一致で、旧514PASS等はそのbytesの範囲で再利用。\n+matrix100MBそのもの/完全localtest/profileは確認のためだけに再実行していない。\n+43original/244embeddedstreams/96excluded、派生goldenを明確化。旧44/95初回checkpoint/Gateは過去状態として保持。\n+初回CI失敗は成功へ書き換えていない。最終HEAD CI/security/merge SHA main検証はこれからで未実施。\n+\n+確認: 入力保護、拒否の非成功分類/他error伝播、明示予算、historical/derived証拠境界、過大保証とtask境界。\n+実害のない好みや新framework/別設計は指摘対象外。修正必須なら直接の受入/回帰/security/provenanceだけ示す。\n+Gate後はverdict/リンク記録とGitHub納品工程のみ予定。strictRSS/OOM防止、100MiB完走、G3全体、第三者検証、production-ready、公開releaseは未達と保持。"},{"sha":"e69de29bb2d1d6434b8b29ae775ad8c2e48c5391","filename":"docs/benchmarks/raw/2026-10-index-build-budget/delivery-fix-companion-stderr.log","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/blob/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%