e_large_corpus_metrics ... ok\n+test release_value_targets_hold_for_ten_megabyte_logs_with_explicit_build_admission ... ok\n+\n+test result: ok. 4 passed; 0 failed; 2 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 11.81s\n+"},{"sha":"5a2943a7b037cb6393d3b53ebd4edc2e6200da4f","filename":"docs/benchmarks/raw/2026-10-index-build-budget/delivery-fix-corpus-input-checks.json","status":"added","additions":41,"deletions":0,"changes":41,"blob_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/blob/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-corpus-input-checks.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/albert-einshutoin/qzt/raw/3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-corpus-input-checks.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albert-einshutoin/qzt/contents/docs%2Fbenchmarks%2Fraw%2F2026-10-index-build-budget%2Fdelivery-fix-corpus-input-checks.json?ref=3d092d1db64fdd3f0744377df98257038eddd32f","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@\n+{\n+  \"binary_sha256\": \"fa4b59924a0c003cf0812fef6fee1a6cd72db67acbd19d21817c4bf7ddbde5bd\",\n+  \"timeout_seconds_per_case\": 5,\n+  \"cases\": [\n+    {\n+      \"label\": \"oversized\",\n+      \"exit_code\": 101,\n+      \"input_bytes\": 4097,\n+      \"output_protection_verified\": true,\n+      \"stderr\": \"\\nthread 'main' (106064845) panicked at scripts/index-build-budget-corpus.rs:14:5:\\ninput exceeds 4096 bytes\\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\\n\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"label\": \"wrong_fields\",\n+      \"exit_code\": 101,\n+      \"input_bytes\": 12,\n+      \"output_protection_verified\": true,\n+      \"stderr\": \"\\nthread 'main' (106064853) panicked at scripts/index-build-budget-corpus.rs:16:5:\\nassertion `left == right` failed: stdin: KIND, BYTES, SEED, OUTPUT on four lines\\n  left: 3\\n right: 4\\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variab